abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of ADAM, a crew-based agentic AI framework for
  decentralized physical infrastructure networks, evaluated on a four-node
  edge testbed for methane monitoring. Combines on-device language-model
  reasoning, semantic memory, and blockchain-backed governance.
keywords:
